OL,3,GNEWSANHS Tayside fined #70,000 after
OL,4,Asafety alarm shortage led to patient's
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FNHS Tayside has been fined #70,000
OL,8,Fafter admitting a shortage of safety
OL,9,Falarms led to the death of an
OL,10,F82-year-old patient.
OL,12,FHigh-risk patient Andrea Imrie fell out
OL,13,Fof her hospital bed after staff took
OL,14,Faway a vital bed-pad falls alarm to
OL,15,Fgive to another patient.
OL,17,FThe health board admitted the safety
OL,18,Ffailure at Murray Royal Hospital in
OL,19,FPerth which led to the patient's death
OL,20,Fon 13 January 2024.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
