OL,3,GNEWSANHS Tayside fined #70,000 after
OL,4,Asafety alarm shortage led to patient's
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FSheriff Jennifer Bain KC said the
OL,8,Fhealth board could have been fined up
OL,9,Fto #1.5m, but limited the fine because
OL,10,Fof the impact it would have on patient
OL,11,Fcare.
